Swarm Tales is source-available. It is not open source in the OSI sense.

## Which license applies to what

- Everything in this repository (kernel, engine, sdk, contracts, CLI, mechanics, Directors, games, prompts,
  library, documentation, run data) is available under the Sustainable Use License below, together with the
  Additional Terms.
- Third-party components keep their original licenses.
- Content of branches other than `main` and `develop` (before the switch of decision A5: `rewrite/develop`) and
  the data branch `data/runs` is not licensed.

